Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Fix alternating rain misses: earlier captcha prewarm,
 stagger dual tasks

Start paid solves in the full prewarm window (not only ~95s before join).
Stagger second 2Captcha task by 10s to reduce queue pile-up; shorten fail
cooldown; discard tokens when rain ends; refresh stale tokens at join.

Co-authored-by: goshennoshen <goshennoshen@onionmail.org>
